{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "1", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Ἀπὸ μικρόθεν μ' ἔλεγεν ὁ γέρων ὁ πατήρ μου·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "2", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "«Παιδίν μου, μάθε γράμματα, καὶ ὡσὰν ἐσέναν ἔχει."}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "3", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Βλέπεις τὸν δεῖνα, τέκνον μου, πεζὸς περιεπάτει,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "4", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ τώρα διπλοεντέληυος καὶ παχυμουλαράτος."}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "5", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Αὐτός, ὅταν ἐμάνθανε, ὑπόδησιν οὐκ εἶχεν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "6", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ τώρα βλέπεις τον φορεῖ τὰ μακρυμύτικά του."}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "7", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Αὐτός, ὅταν ἐμάνθανε, ποτέ του οὐκ ἐκτενίσβη,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "8", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ τώρα καλοκτένιστος καὶ καμαροτριχάρης."}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "9", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Αὐτός, ὅταν ἐμάνθανε, λουτρόθυραν οὐκ εἶδε,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "10", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ τώρα λουτρακίζεται τρίτον τὴν ἑβδομάδα."}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "11", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Αὐτός, ὁ κόλπος του ἔγεμε φθεῖρας άμυγδαλάτας,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "12", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ τώρα τὰ ὑπέρπυρα γέμει τὰ μανοηλάτα."}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "13", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Καὶ πείσθητι γεροντικοῖς καὶ πατρικοῖς μου λόγοις,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "14", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ μάθε τὰ γραμματικά, καὶ ὡσὰν ἐσέναν ἔχει.»"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "15", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Καὶ ἔμαθον τὰ γράμματα μετὰ πολλοῦ τοῦ κόπου."}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "16", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Ἀφ᾽ οὗ δὲ τάχα γέγονα γραμματικὸς τεχνίτης,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "17", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἐπιθυμῶ καὶ τὸ ψωμὶν καὶ τοῦ ψωμιοῦ τὴν μάνναν·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "18", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὑβρίζω τὰ γραμματικά, λέγω μετὰ δακρύων·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "19", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "«Ἀνάθεμαν τὰ γράμματα, Χριστέ, καὶ ὁποὺ τὰ θέλει,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "20", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἀνάθεμαν καὶ τὸν καιρὸν καὶ ἐκείνην τὴν ἡμέραν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "21", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καθ᾽ ἥν μὲ παρεδώκασιν εἰς τὸ διδασκαλεῖον,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "22", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "πρὸς τὸ νὰ μάθω γράμματα, τάχα νὰ ζῶ ἀπ᾽ ἐκεῖνα!»"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "23", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Ἐδάρε τότε ἄν μ᾽ ἔποικαν τεχνίτην χρυσοράπτην,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "24", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἀπ᾽ αὐτοὺς ὁποὺ κάμνουσι τὰ κλαπτωτὰ καὶ ζῶσι,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "25", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἔμαθα τέχνην κλαπωτὴν τὴν περιφρονημένην,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "26", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "οὐ μὴ ἤνοιγα τὸ ἀρμάριν μου καὶ ηὕρισκα ὅτι γέμει"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "27", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ψωμίν, κρασίν πληθυντικὸν καὶ θυννομαγειρίαν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "28", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ παλαμιδοκόμματα καὶ τσίρους καὶ σκουμπρία·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "29", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "παρ᾽ οὗ ὅτι τώρα ἀνοίγω το, βλέπω τοὺς πάτους ὅλους,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "30", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ βλέπω χαρτοσάκουλα γεμάτα μὲ χαρτία."}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "31", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Ἀνοίγω τὴν ἀρκλίτσαν μου, νὰ εὕρω ψωμὶν κομμάτιν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "32", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ εὑρίσκω χαρτοσάκουλον ἄλλο μικροτερίτσιν."}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "33", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Ἁπλώνω εἰς τὸ περσίκιν μου, γυρεύω τὸ πουγγίν μου,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "34", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "διὰ στάμενον τὸ ψηλαφῶ, καὶ αὐτὸ γέμει χαρτία."}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "35", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Ἀφ᾽ οὗ δὲ τὰς γωνίας μου τὰς ὅλας ψηλαφήσω,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "36", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τότε κατηφὴς καὶ ἀπομεριμνημένος,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "37", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "λιποθυμῶ καὶ ὀλιγωρῶ ἐκ τῆς πολλῆς μου πείνας·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "38", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἀπὸ τὴν πείναν τὴν πολλὴν καὶ τὴν στενοχωρίαν"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "39", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "γραμμάτων καὶ γραμματικῶν τὰ κλαπωτὰ προκρίνω."}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "40", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Ἀφῆτε με, ἐξαφῆτε με, τώρα ἡ ψυχή μου ἐρράγη·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "41", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "εἶπα την, καὶ ἀπεστράφη με καὶ ὀργῆς ἰχάδιν ἔχει·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "42", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τί ἔνι τὸ φονικοϊχάδιν σου, φονεύτρα, νὰ μὲ πλήξης;"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "43", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "«Εἶπες το κι ἐξαναεῖπες το, κἂν θέλης πάλιν εἰπέ το·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "44", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἂν οὐκ ἐλεῆς τὸ στόμαν σου, λάλει καὶ πάλιν λάλει·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "45", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "δωρεὰν ὀχλεῖσαι, νεώτερε, μετ᾽ ἄλλον ὅρκους ἔχω.»"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "46", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "«Καὶ οἱ ὅρκοι παραβαίνονται καὶ οἱ λόγοι μεταστρέφουν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "47", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἀγάπαι μετατίθενται πρὸς τούτους ἐξ ἐκείνων·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "48", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τεὼς δὲ τοὺς ὅρκους τοῦ ἔρωτος μηδὲ προβάλλεσαί τους,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.ptochoprodromika", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "49", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἐρώτησε καὶ νὰ σὲ εἰποῦν οὐκ ἔχουν οἱ ὅρκοι κρίμαν.»"}
